    {
      "description": "Insert copies of elements (JSON as in doc.get, e.g. from another document) on top of the z-order, offset by dx_mm/dy_mm. New ids are assigned, groups among the pasted elements are kept as new groups, and locks are cleared. Images need their asset in the document or in `assets`. Returns {ids}.",
      "id": "element.paste",
